{"id":"b9fd59242fb4200e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-assignment.md","title":"Second-Order Assignment","display":"df-so-assignment — Second-Order Assignment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-assignment","aliases":["57-df-so-assignment"],"display":"df-so-assignment — Second-Order Assignment","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-so-var]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-assignment — Second-Order Assignment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq A^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 为候选函数，修改函数的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma[X/R]\">\\(\\gamma[X/R]\\)</span> 的变量在前、关系在后次序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\eta:\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\to\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal P(A^n)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\;(\\eta(X)\\subseteq A^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\eta:\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\to\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal P(A^n)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\;(\\eta(X)\\subseteq A^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma[X/R]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,Z\\rangle:Y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\land[(Y=X\\land Z=R)\\lor(Y\\ne X\\land Z=\\gamma(Y))]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma[X/R]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,Z\\rangle:Y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\land[(Y=X\\land Z=R)\\lor(Y\\ne X\\land Z=\\gamma(Y))]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma[X/R]\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma[X/R]\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>元数一致性是成为二阶赋值的条件，不是对一个已错误接纳的任意函数附加断言。赋值修改不再只在注释中出现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-var","status":"resolved","id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-var]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-var","status":"resolved","id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。$\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$ 取 [[57-df-so-var]]，$n\\ge1$，$X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$，$R\\subseteq A^n$；$\\eta$ 为候选函数，修改函数的参数 $\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)$。保留 $\\gamma[X/R]$ 的变量在前、关系在后次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma[X/R]","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\eta:\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\to\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal P(A^n)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\;(\\eta(X)\\subseteq A^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma[X/R]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,Z\\rangle:Y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^